# Files under raw/ that /ingest and the completeness check may skip.
# Everything else under raw/ must be cited by a wiki page's `sources:` or
# listed in raw/MANIFEST.md as excluded — that is what "ingested" means.
**/.gitkeep
**/README.md
MANIFEST.md
manuscript/LOCKED.md
.ingestignore
inbox/**
private/**
inventory/**
**/*.log
**/*.aux
**/*.bbl
**/*.blg
**/*.out
**/*.toc
**/*.synctex.gz
**/_site/**
**/.quarto/**
